## Performance and Rhetoric: How The KLF Did It

<img src="https://www.theinfluencers.org/sites/theinfluencers.mur.at/files/393_k_foundation_burn_a_million_quid_1.jpg" height=100% width=100%>

**Course**: ENC 1101

**Instructor**: Glenn S. Ritchey III

The KLF spent a primary decade or so making and unmaking themselves — building audiences, mastering genres, and walking away from every success before it could become comfortable. Today you're going to map out exactly how they did it. Each group will analyze one of the rhetorical moves that defined their career.

### What you'll do

1. Work through two focused discussions with your group

2. Share your findings with the class

